            "notes": "Continue scaling up with increasing ammo count and weapon power. Early on this can help with your one clip ability, especially prior to teams being able to stack armor to counter you. If the other team starts stack armor in a few rounds, you will be swapping to AP anyways. If you struggled with living last round, look for a few of the other survival talents such as armored vest or ironclad exhaust ports. The cash generation at this stage is too important to inting in and die every fight. Look to finish off or contribute in any high bounties on the other team.",
