            "notes": "This is the last round of true ammo and weapon power stacking. At this point if you have been terrorizing the enemy supports and DPS there is a chance that they have started picking buys against you or began armor stacking. There is a chance that your lethality goes down this round, especially if the team comes out with large amounts of armor. If this is the case, play it safe and work to max out cash generation for one last round. With Get Stuffed added you can build pulse bombs much fast if you can weave in frequent melees in fights. This works great with charged plating which can give large amounts of armor over the span of the round, as well as increasing the power of your mini pulse bombs through Pocket Bomb.",
