            "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:55:00.200716+00:00",
            "notes": "Here comes the swap to ability power. Lumerico Fusion Drive provides great survivability and with charged plating allows even more armor regeneration in prolonged fights to give you much longer staying power before you have to dip out to safety. Chrono Bomb allows you to effectively zone out teams with your recall bombs. While the Pocket Bomb's don't have one shot potential, the damage is not negligible and now begins debuffing the enemy team providing some additional utility and disruption in team fights. Be advised the pulse effects you as well so try not to recall directly onto your own bombs if you can. Mark of the Kitsune can be procced either off of your pistols or melee at this time to increase your burst damage.",
