            "notes": "The full build is online by now. The last addition of superflexor effectively gives you roughly 65% AP at this time as it's nearly always capped during fights. Weave in as many blink + melee combos during fights as you can. This by themselves can chunk most DPS and support down to roughly half health and will displace them with the minor knockback through Flash Fist. You can also start to disrupt the enemy tank with this to throw off their positioning and farm out your bombs. Charged Plating continues to scale incredibly well throughout the round, often letting you near the 100% AP mark near the end of the round, giving extra armor to be restored through Lumerico Fusion Drive.",
