            "created_at": "2025-09-25T05:55:00.739022+00:00",
            "notes": "The biggest decision last round is what round 7 power to take. Most of the weapon related powers don't really play into the build that much. Foresight allows some increased lethality if you don't always have the best mechanical aim. Depending on the other team composition, bullet time can wreck havoc on projectile heroes. Seeing a Zen be nearly helpless in the middle of the zone is a sight to behold and if coordinated with your team he can be quickly eliminated. The addition of Phantasmic Flux gives you even more overhealth to increase your ability to last nearly indefinitely in team fights.",
